From: Somraj Mani <somraj.mani@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 14:24:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] [BOLT][ARM] Support instrumentation

Implement the instrumentation hooks for ARM and Thumb: counter increment,
indirect-call handlers and the table/counter getters. Counters are
incremented with an exclusive load/store loop, as there are no LSE
atomics on AArch32.

createInstrumentationSnippet() is shared by all targets and previously
used BC.MIB directly. On ARM that is the ARM-mode builder, so Thumb
functions were instrumented with ARM encodings. Pass the builder selected
for the instrumented function instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tdyp9Tb7sLvWDoCC5m4ACC
---
 bolt/include/bolt/Passes/Instrumentation.h |  7 +++-
 bolt/lib/Passes/Instrumentation.cpp        | 47 +++++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 33 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

diff --git a/bolt/include/bolt/Passes/Instrumentation.h b/bolt/include/bolt/Passes/Instrumentation.h
index 76ffcf41db6e..7a87187f9612 100644
--- a/bolt/include/bolt/Passes/Instrumentation.h
+++ b/bolt/include/bolt/Passes/Instrumentation.h
@@ -63,9 +63,12 @@ private:
                              uint32_t ToNodeID, bool Instrumented);
   void createLeafNodeDescription(FunctionDescription &FuncDesc, uint32_t Node);
 
-  /// Create the sequence of instructions to increment a counter
+  /// Create the sequence of instructions to increment a counter, encoded
+  /// with \p MIB. Pass BC.getMIBFor() of the function the snippet is
+  /// inserted into, not BC.MIB: on ARM the two differ for Thumb functions.
   InstructionListType createInstrumentationSnippet(BinaryContext &BC,
-                                                   bool IsLeaf);
+                                                   bool IsLeaf,
+                                                   MCPlusBuilder *MIB);
 
   // Critical edges worklist
   // This worklist keeps track of CFG edges <From-To> that needs to be split.
diff --git a/bolt/lib/Passes/Instrumentation.cpp b/bolt/lib/Passes/Instrumentation.cpp
index ae9faf4e9cc2..6f73067480ab 100644
--- a/bolt/lib/Passes/Instrumentation.cpp
